@startuml Add Product to Cart Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
title Add Product to Cart Use Case\n(הוספת מוצר לעגלה)

actor "User\n(משתמש)" as User
participant "Product Details Page\n(עמוד פרטי מוצר)" as ProductPage
participant "Cart Reducer\n(Redux)" as CartReducer
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Card Controller" as CardController
participant "Card Model\n(MongoDB)" as CardModel
participant "Product Model\n(MongoDB)" as ProductModel

User -> ProductPage: Click "Add to Cart" button\n(לחיצה על "הוסף לעגלה")
activate ProductPage

ProductPage -> ProductPage: Check if user is logged in\n(בדיקה אם המשתמש מחובר)

alt User not logged in
    ProductPage --> User: Redirect to login page\n(הפניה לעמוד התחברות)
else User logged in
    ProductPage -> ProductPage: Get product details:\n- productId\n- userId\n- quantity\n(קבלת פרטי המוצר)
    
    ProductPage -> CartReducer: dispatch(add_to_card({userId, productId, quantity}))
    activate CartReducer
    
    CartReducer -> API: POST /api/home/card/add-to-card
    activate API
    
    API -> CardController: add_to_card(req, res)
    activate CardController
    
    CardController -> CardController: Validate request body\n(בדיקת תקינות הבקשה)
    
    alt Missing required fields
        CardController --> API: 400 - Missing required fields
        API --> CartReducer: Error response
        CartReducer --> ProductPage: Show error message
        ProductPage --> User: Display error\n(הצגת שגיאה)
    else Valid request
        CardController -> CardController: Convert IDs to ObjectId\n(המרת מזהים ל-ObjectId)
        
        CardController -> CardModel: findOne({userId, productId})
        activate CardModel
        CardModel --> CardController: Check if product exists in cart\n(בדיקה אם המוצר קיים בעגלה)
        deactivate CardModel
        
        alt Product already in cart
            CardController --> API: 404 - Product Already Added To Card
            API --> CartReducer: Error response
            CartReducer --> ProductPage: Show error message
            ProductPage --> User: Display "Product already in cart"\n(הצגת "מוצר כבר בעגלה")
        else Product not in cart
            CardController -> CardModel: create({userId, productId, quantity})
            activate CardModel
            CardModel --> CardController: Product added to cart\n(מוצר נוסף לעגלה)
            deactivate CardModel
            
            CardController --> API: 201 - Added To Card Successfully
            deactivate CardController
            
            API --> CartReducer: Success response
            deactivate API
            
            CartReducer -> CartReducer: Update cart state\n(עדכון מצב העגלה)
            
            CartReducer --> ProductPage: Product added successfully
            deactivate CartReducer
            
            ProductPage --> User: Show success message\n"Added to cart"\n(הצגת הודעת הצלחה)
        end
    end
end

deactivate ProductPage

note right of CardController
  Validation includes:
  - userId must be valid ObjectId
  - productId must be valid ObjectId
  - quantity must be positive number
  
  (בדיקות תקינות כוללות מזהים ותקינות כמות)
end note

note right of CardModel
  Cart document structure:
  - userId: ObjectId (ref to customer)
  - productId: ObjectId (ref to product)
  - quantity: Number
  - timestamps: createdAt, updatedAt
end note

@enduml
